# The site is static HTML; there are no server env vars.
# To enable real enquiry submission, add before the main script in index.html:
#   <script>window.CREO_FORM_ENDPOINT="https://your-endpoint.example/enquiry"</script>
# The endpoint must accept multipart/form-data POST and return HTTP 2xx on success.
# Without it, the enquiry flow honestly falls back to a pre-filled WhatsApp message.
